'''Elle of The Nether''' was an [[NPC]] in the {{zone|Blazing Fortress}} at {{Coordinates|-311|96|-405}}. She was a part of the ''Warriors quest'' [[Quest]]. 

== Quest ==
Elle's quest required the player to gather {{Item|Nether Wart|amount=10}} and {{Item|Blaze Rod|amount=10}}s. Afterwards, the player needs to collect {{Item|Magma Cream|amount=1}}, {{Item|Glowstone|amount=1}} and {{Item|Nether Quartz|amount=1}}. Elle's quest had a bug, which required the player to manually collect the items without {{ench|Telekinesis}}. 

