=== Costs ===
==== Calculator ====
Assuming that the factor is the same for all pets the cost is calculated as follows:

* <math>\text{cost} = \text{base price} - 0.3\% \times \text{pet level}</math>
* <math>\text{cost} = \text{base price} \times (1 - 0.003 \times \text{pet level})</math>

"Base Price" in the calculation / calculator is based on the value in the table listed below

{{Calculator:KatCost}}

To get the base price for a given pet you can calculate:

*<math>\text{base price} = -\frac{1000 \times \text{cost}}{3 \times \text{pet level} - 1000}</math>

{{Calculator:KatBasePrice}}
<!--
==== Base Price ====
The following table contains ''base prices'' as well as prices for unknown levels. Please correct the prices for unknown levels (marked with <sup>''NBP''</sup>). You can use the base price calculator from above.

For any price without <sup>''NBP''</sup>, you can assume <code style="background-color:rgba(75, 75, 75, 0.5)"> - 0.3% per Level</code>.

Time taken also lowers per level, though the amount is unknown.-->

{{/Costs}}

== Trivia ==
* '''Kat''' upgrades pets in real-time instead of [[Time Systems|SkyBlock Time]].
* Pets at higher levels will take less {{c}} to upgrade at '''Kat''': the discount is {{Green|0.3%}} per level, and is unaffected by [[Pet Items]] and the pet's rarity.
** Pet Items and Carrot Candy usages are not affected by '''Kat'''.
* An upgraded pet will have its level recalculated based on its cumulative experience.
* The {{Item|Bingo Pet}}, {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}}, {{Item|Kuudra Pet}}, {{Item|Montezuma Pet}}, and {{Item|Wisp Pet}} cannot be upgraded by '''Kat''' and are instead upgraded through other means.
* The skin used for Kat is a reference to [[Bulb:Serena_(anime)|Serena]], a deuteragonist of the anime ''Pokémon X/Y'', and the female protagonist of the games of the same name.
* There is currently a bug that if you warp to another server before Kat finishes her dialogue and gives you the pet, you will permanently lose your pet, and you wont be able to salvage it from Jerry.
* Upgrading a pet while '''Kat''' is still talking about having upgraded your pet results in the upgrading dialogue being skipped.
* The {{Attr|Kat's Favorite}} ({{Item|Kiwi Shard}}) Attribute implies that Kiwi is her favorite animal.

